    "narrative": {
      "fields": {
        "text": "The building is served by three packaged rooftop units (RTU-1 to RTU-3), one direct-fired make-up air unit (MAU-1) for the kitchen, two exhaust fans and three VAV terminals.\nAll systems were balanced to within ±10 % of design where possible; see the Summary pages for exceptions.\nNotes: \"Not Acc.\" = not accessible; readings marked N/A do not apply. Coil ΔP on RTU-3 < 0.1 in. w.g. could not be read."
      }
    },
